{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Spectacle: Worlds Unseen</i> is a cancelled project from 2023 that we have decided to release for free in its unfinished state. Because of this, players should expect to encounter mechanics that are not fully explained as well as some bugs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are excited to see players engage with the strange world of <i>Spectacle</i> and are interested to hear your thoughts on what could have been.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700150/extras/bf38143c4e11769149e8bdd9eef0837c.poster.avif?t=1749215687\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700150/extras/bf38143c4e11769149e8bdd9eef0837c.webm?t=1749215687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Hold either one of the mouse buttons down to blink or wink, thus changing and interacting with your surroundings. The buttons on your mouse act as your character\u2019s eyes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700150/extras/ab8acc350f04832a1f5a7e0e886a4979.poster.avif?t=1749215687\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700150/extras/ab8acc350f04832a1f5a7e0e886a4979.webm?t=1749215687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Discover a spectacular world where sight is everything and nothing is as it seems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Spectacle you switch between glasses that enable you to look at the world in different ways to solve the puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700150/extras/0e86983bece709f409593d7e77cb43c7.poster.avif?t=1749215687\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700150/extras/0e86983bece709f409593d7e77cb43c7.webm?t=1749215687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Explore mind-twisting puzzles where observation, spatial reasoning, and line of sight are your best tools.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700150/extras/9fd1cb756a6fba322b719549cd952c51.poster.avif?t=1749215687\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700150/extras/9fd1cb756a6fba322b719549cd952c51.webm?t=1749215687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Trip Space is a surreal universe where parallel spaces, perspective changes, and match cuts dictate how you perceive the world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2700150?t=1749215687","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749215687","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700150/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749215687","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700150/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749215687","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Spectacle: Worlds Unseen</i> is a cancelled project from 2023 that we have decided to release f